---
title: MCP Server Tasks
id: server-tasks
order: 13
description: "A long MCP tool returns a task handle so the host can poll for the result."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - mcp
  - model context protocol
  - mcp server
  - execution
  - task handle
  - createMCPServer
  - inMemoryTaskStore
  - waitUntil
---
